abstract: >-
  Foundational research program and multimodal computational engine originated by Jair Ivan Rojas Ruiz
  (ORCID: 0009-0003-1109-4583) for measuring, formalizing, and simulating how audiovisual and symbolic
  narratives operate as dynamic signals across linguistic, acoustic, and visual layers, including the
  core metrics of Narrative DNA, Narrative Energy, Narrative Entropy, Narrative Inertia, Narrative
  Complexity, and Narrative Controllability.
